cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its astrodynamics methodology in academic work or mission planning, please cite it as below."
title: "LunarSite Compass: Deterministic Temporal Horizon Ray-Casting & Dual-Constraint Mission Windows for CLPS Lunar South Pole Landers"
abstract: "An open-source astrodynamics and planetary topography platform computing exact topocentric ephemerides, spherical geodesic ray-casting with lunar curvature drop, and dual-constraint power and communication windows for lunar polar missions using NASA JPL Horizons and LRO LOLA DEM datasets."
authors:
  - name: "Team Antigravity"
    affiliation: "Secondary School Explorers & Aerospace Systems Laboratory"
